     These macros are provided for manipulating _t_i_m_e_v_a_l and _t_i_m_e_s_p_e_c struc‐
     tures for use with the clock_gettime(2), clock_settime(2),
     gettimeofday(2) and settimeofday(2) calls.  The _t_i_m_e_v_a_l structure is de‐
     fined in <_s_y_s_/_t_i_m_e_._h> as:

     struct timeval {
             long    tv_sec;         /* seconds since Jan. 1, 1970 */
             long    tv_usec;        /* and microseconds */
     };

     And the _t_i_m_e_s_p_e_c structure is defined in <_t_i_m_e_._h> as:

     struct timespec {
             time_t tv_sec;          /* seconds */
